{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, מְנֵא²","hw":"מְנֵא²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְנֵא</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong> [<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>maneh, mina</strong>, a weight <strong>(</strong>v. BH; Old Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">מנה</span> SAC<sup>75</sup> Lzb<sup>313</sup><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:25\" href=\"/Daniel.5.25\">Dn 5:25</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:26\" href=\"/Daniel.5.26\">26</a>, v. ClGann<sup>JAs Juillet-Août, 1886, 36 ff.</sup> Nö<sup>ZA i. 414 f.</sup> Dr al.; its connexion in Dn with <span dir=\"rtl\">מְנָה</span> is due to word-play; v. also <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, פְּרֵס\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_פְּרֵס\", dir=\"rtl\">פְּרֵס</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, תְּקֵל\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_תְּקֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">תְּקֵל</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, מִנְיָן","prev":"BDB Aramaic, מְנָה"}